{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:54 2026-07-09 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:54 2026-07-09 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:54 2026-07-09 HKT</p><p>今（9日）晨10時許，兩名老翁在秀茂坪樂華北邨巴士站發生激烈爭執，繼而大打出手，警方接報到場，兩老翁分別膝部及鼻部受傷，由救護車一併送院。據了解，兩人為街坊，素有積怨，二人涉嫌「在公眾地方打架」罪被捕。</p><p></p><img alt=\"警方檢走一些涉案物件。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c4da5886ddc2c88c26b03d492fccab3/2026-07/01_7.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方檢走一些涉案物件。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/63f2fe103ef9b535408639656d441bcb/2026-07/02_6.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"傷者送院治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5b678916876fe03793ffadcd491889db/2026-07/03_5.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"傷者送院治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ffa9c40d15fc80cc42307960bb1a08c2/2026-07/04_3.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"傷者送院治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bfceb6c3b2905a1ff28d1a04b4c5c34a/2026-07/05_2.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-09T03:59:50.742030+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}